sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor O as Desi
  participant G as GitHub
  participant CI as GitHub Actions
  participant V as Vercel
  participant CDN as Vercel Edge Network

  O->>G: Push branch with edited MDX / code
  O->>G: Open pull request
  G->>CI: Trigger workflow
  CI->>CI: Install, lint, typecheck, unit tests, build, e2e, a11y
  G->>V: Trigger preview deployment
  V-->>G: Preview URL on PR
  O->>V: Review preview (desktop + mobile)
  CI-->>G: Checks pass
  O->>G: Merge to main
  G->>V: Production build
  V->>CDN: Promote static assets + serverless function
  CDN-->>O: Live on custom domain
  Note over V: Broken release? Instant rollback to previous deployment
